# ============================================================
# Comparison of pooled out-of-fold test AUCs from 10-fold CV
#
# Models:
#   Host model
#   MADE model
#   MADE & Host model
#
# Bar height:
#   pooled out-of-fold test AUC
#
# Error bars:
